  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women leaders and defenders prevention and protection programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to strengthen capacities of civil society and public institutions to design and implement policies and initiatives for the prevention and protection of life, integrity and the role of human rights leaders at the national level and in the prioritized territories</narrative>
  </description>
